# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore - Sistem Informasi Personel SSDM POLRI (Presisi)
# Direktori Root Proyek
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. ARSIP BACKUP LOKAL (Ukuran Sangat Besar)
# Alasan: File zip hasil backup.ps1 berukuran ~7MB per arsip. Jika diunggah,
# ukuran repo Git akan membengkak ratusan MB dan terkena limit push GitHub.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/backups/
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.7z

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. HASIL KOMPILASI BINER BACKEND GO (Executables)
# Alasan: File executable biner (.exe) platform-specific (Windows) dan dapat
# dikompilasi ulang kapan saja via 'go build'. Menyimpan biner di repo Git
# adalah bad practice dan rawan dianggap malware oleh security scanner.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/infopers_backend/infopers_server.exe
/infopers_backend/*.exe

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. DEPENDENSI NODE.JS / NPM (Ratusan Megabyte)
# Alasan: Berisi puluhan ribu file library yang dapat dipasang otomatis lewat
# perintah 'npm install' berdasarkan package.json & package-lock.json.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
/infopers_frontend/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. HASIL BUILD & CACHE NEXT.JS (Turbopack Artifacts)
# Alasan: Berkas cache kompilasi otomatis dari 'npm run build' / 'npm run dev'.
# Selalu di-generate ulang secara lokal dan tidak boleh disimpan di Git.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.next/
/infopers_frontend/.next/
out/
/infopers_frontend/out/
build/
/infopers_frontend/build/
dist/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. KREDENSIAL, KUNCI RAHASIA & ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Keamanan Siber)
# Alasan: Mencegah kebocoran password database PostgreSQL, JWT Secret Key,
# API token, dan konfigurasi server ke repositori publik/privat GitHub.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env*.local
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.cert

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. FILE LOG, TEST & RUNTIME TEMPORARY
# Alasan: File log berubah setiap detik saat aplikasi dijalankan dan mengotori
# riwayat commit git (git history noise).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.tmp
*.temp

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. BACKUP & DUMP BASIS DATA DENGAN DATA PERSONEL RIIL
# Alasan: Menjaga kerahasiaan data kepolisian (UU Perlindungan Data Pribadi / PDP).
# Data mentah 483.355 personel tidak boleh bocor ke publik.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sql.gz
*.dump
*.backup

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. SISTEM OPERASI & KONFIGURASI IDE/EDITOR LOKAL
# Alasan: File konfigurasi personal editor (VSCode, JetBrains) dan file sampah
# bawaan sistem operasi (Windows / macOS) yang tidak relevan dengan source code.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
